Offline Stamping & Signing Solution (Interview Answer)

Problem:
The organization was using a manual process for stamp paper purchase and document signing. Customers had to visit physical centers, purchase stamp paper offline, and sign documents manually. This process was time-consuming, increased operational costs, and delayed loan processing and customer onboarding.

My Role:
I was responsible for designing and implementing the backend integration for the digital eSign and eStamp solution. I worked closely with the business team, third-party vendors, and the frontend team to understand the requirements and integrate the required APIs into our application.

Solution:
I integrated the Leegality eSign and eStamp platform into our loan processing system. The solution automated the complete document execution process:

Generated documents dynamically.
Purchased eStamp paper electronically through the Leegality API.
Sent documents to customers for Aadhaar-based eSign.
Tracked the signing status in real time.
Downloaded the final legally signed and stamped document automatically.
Stored the signed documents securely in the document management system.

This eliminated the need for physical stamp papers and manual signatures.

Technology Used:

Backend: ASP.NET Core (.NET 8) with C#
API Integration: REST APIs using HttpClient
Authentication: API Key / OAuth (based on vendor specification)
Data Format: JSON
Database: SQL Server / Oracle
Logging: Serilog
Error Handling: Retry mechanism, exception handling, and API response validation
Architecture: Repository Pattern, Dependency Injection, Clean Architecture
Version Control: Git
Deployment: Azure / IIS

Business Impact:

Reduced the document execution time from several days to the same day.
Enabled same-day eStamp purchase and Aadhaar-based eSign.
Eliminated manual paperwork and physical document handling.
Reduced operational costs and human errors.
Improved customer experience through a completely digital process.
Accelerated loan disbursement and customer onboarding.
Ensured legal compliance with digitally signed and electronically stamped documents.
Increased process efficiency and reduced turnaround time (TAT), helping the business process applications faster.
One-Line Interview Summary

"I integrated the Leegality eSign and eStamp APIs using ASP.NET Core and C#, enabling customers to purchase eStamp papers and complete legally valid Aadhaar-based digital signatures on the same day. This digitized the document execution process, reduced turnaround time, improved customer experience, and accelerated loan processing."
